NOTE ON DATA:
StatsBomb 360 event and freeze-frame data are proprietary commercial assets of
StatsBomb Services Ltd., obtained under a research-use academic licence. The
raw data are NOT included in this release. Only derived statistics, model
weights, and reproduction notebooks are provided. To reproduce the full pipeline
from scratch, a separate StatsBomb academic licence is required; see
DATA_AVAILABILITY.md in the data/ directory for details.
